  "version": "1",
  "description": "Figure 3a of Todd et al. 2024 (arXiv:2310.15213) and a DBM extension on GPT-J 6B: harvest every head's mean output over clean 10-shot prompts per task (mean_heads_early, mean_heads_late); put each head's mean alone into shuffled-label prompts (scan_early, scan_late), which scripts/function_vectors_fig3a/fig3a_figure.py averages into the indirect effect of Figure 3a; harvest each layer's mean (mean_L0 to mean_L27); fit one head-grouped gate per layer that sets the selected heads to their means, six tasks per step (dbm_fit_1 to dbm_fit_3, Davies et al. 2023, arXiv:2307.03637), and replay the gates on held-out prompts (dbm_apply_1 to dbm_apply_3).",
